# x4 compositional proof stage 2: prove a1 strongly dominates a2.

variable x0
variable x1
variable x2
variable y0
variable y1
variable y2
variable c0
variable c1
variable c2

assume x0 strongly_dominates x1
assume x1 strongly_dominates x2
assume y0 strongly_dominates y1
assume y1 strongly_dominates y2
assume c0 strongly_dominates c1
assume c1 strongly_dominates c2

variable p00
variable e00
two_prod x0 y0 p00 e00

variable p01
variable e01
two_prod x0 y1 p01 e01

variable p10
variable e10
two_prod x1 y0 p10 e10

variable p02
variable e02
two_prod x0 y2 p02 e02

variable p11
variable e11
two_prod x1 y1 p11 e11

variable p20
variable e20
two_prod x2 y0 p20 e20

# b/r and a1/f1:f4.
two_sum p00 c0
two_sum p01 p10
two_sum p01 e00
two_sum p01 c1
two_sum p01 c0

# a2/g1:g9.
two_sum p02 p20
two_sum p02 p11
two_sum e01 e10
two_sum p02 e01
two_sum p02 c2
two_sum p02 p10
two_sum p02 e00
two_sum p02 c1
two_sum p02 c0

prove p01 strongly_dominates p02
